  characterName: Ivan
  dialogueText: My wife, before she died, became obsessed with those damn circles.
    She was so sensitive, I wanted to protect her from using AI before she was properly
    trained. She got a hold of an old laptop somehow and started talking to a chat
    bot. I lost her about a month later.
  choices:
  - text: 'Obie: I''m so sorry... I didn''t know.'
